## Fill sequence for `approved_digests.json` (exp_05)

After the four `full` trainings (`ckpt/exp05/{S,L}_{simple,cylindrical}/attempt_<ts>/`, `final` promoted by the launcher), at one final commit C with a clean tree:
1. Land finding 1 (and any nits) first, so C's `tools.param_curve` closure is the one the record pins.
